% KDP asks for 0.125in + 6in + 200 x 0.002252in + 6in + 0.125in, which
% is 12.7004in. TeX stores the fraction of a dimension with 16-bit
% precision, so 0.002252in becomes 0.0022583in and the result is
% 12.7016in (917.94601pt) -- 0.03mm wider, which no printer can see.
\showthe\paperwidth

